Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(fullscreen):=20fingir=20=C3=A9xito=20del=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?cambio=20de=20modo=20en=20macOS=20(borderless=20a=20resoluci?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=B3n=20nativa)?=
